### Update the daily schedule
PUT http://localhost:8080/schedules/daily
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expr": "0 9 * * *"
}

### Get the next three daily schedule times
POST http://localhost:8080/schedules/daily/next
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "after": "2026-10-09T08:00:00Z",
  "count": 3
}